    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QLewds</strong> is an upcoming Free-to-Play 3 vs 3 online multiplayer clash in a large 2D arena. The game aims to bridge aspects of MOBAs, Metroidvanias, 2D Platformers, and Brawlers into a novel gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory is achieved for one team by destroying the enemy's <strong>throne</strong>. <strong>Thrones </strong>are invulnerable until the opposing team collects enough Ether. Ether is gained in a variety of ways, including destroying enemy team's <strong>flowers </strong>, killing enemy players, and other unique in game objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay is split between day and night cycles. During daytime players can focus on the <strong>lanes</strong>, where the <strong>flowers </strong>are active. At night the game opens up, with the flowers sleeping and neutral enemies spawning throughout the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basically, you begin the game weak, slow, and pathetic. Then you end it like a champ leveling up,  earning gold, buying upgraded skills, passive upgrades, and active upgrades, beating scary bosses, making sick plays, discovering hidden secrets, sniping some queeps, laughing at a scrub, and probably some other stuff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a game, have fun, sorry about the lava.</p>",
